  "description": {
   "en": "The legendary absurd horror works of Ichiro Hirai, a genius among the magazine \"Suspense \u0026 Horror\" that led the horror boom of the 90s, are revived digitally!\nThe first installment is the strange tale of Kyosuke and Kyoko, siblings!\nWhen you ride the subway with a certain man, trouble always occurs...\nThe second installment will keep you smiling and nervous!\n\nIncludes work commentary and afterword!\n\n---\nVolume 1: Kyousuke-kun\n\n1 ◆ 二階\n2 ◆ 犬\n3 ◆ まね\n4 ◆ アイスクリーム\n5 ◆ わりこみ\n6 ◆ ラジコン\n7 ◆ 立ち読み\n8 ◆ 百足\n9 ◆ 静電気\n10 ◆ 風\n11 ◆ 蟻\n12 ◆ 京介くんVS葬式戦隊ゴリンジュー\n13 ◆ 京介くん 転校生を笑わせろ\n\n---\nVolume 2: Kowai Mono Shirazu\n\n1 ◆ 地下鉄\n2 ◆ 影絵\n3 ◆ ひとちがい\n4 ◆ 蜘蛛\n5 ◆ 見えないあの子\n6 ◆ 「置くな」の場所\n7 ◆ ジンマシンの記憶・\n8 ◆ もう一人の転校生\n9 ◆ こわいもの知らず\n10 ◆ 捨て牌"
  },
